WEBVTT


00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:31.917
17th-century Japan,


00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:34.713
the Tokugawa era.


00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:38.833
In a poor village, a boy was born.


00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.271
His name was Kamui.


00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:46.718
Among the lowest class
in a hierarchical society


00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:49.308
the boy grew up strong and tough.


00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:52.834
Kamui had just one wish -


00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:54.234
to become strong.


00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:58.708
To him that meant
living as a free person.


00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:03.836
One day the boy left the village


00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:07.073
and set out on a journey
without destination.


00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:10.317
But all that he found was a constant


00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:13.512
cold, high wall.


00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:17.355
Because he was poor, he became a ninja.


00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:19.550
As a ninja, he perfected his skills.


00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:22.995
And with those skills he
hurt and killed others.


00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:24.872
He was also bound by
the code of the ninja.


00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:28.114
Eventually he broke away on his own


00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:31.835
and consequently was hounded
to the brink of death.


00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:33.075
But...


00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:37.591
the real enemy is not the endless
attacks by the ninja who pursue him.


00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:40.675
It is his own heart


00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.870
that can trust no one.


00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:47.158
Is the life that he dreams
of impossible in this world?


00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:50.318
Nevertheless


00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:53.318
Kamui keeps running...


00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:56.915
in order to survive.


00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:10.796
KAMUI : THE LONE NINJA


00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:22.079
Then, a fateful encounter.


00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:26.550
There was a woman who
was fighting to survive.


00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:35.159
It's bad karma, Sugaru.


00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:38.431
When your father Ieft the ninja
for the sake of a few coins


00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:41.358
who hunted him down and killed him?


00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:44.036
Sugaru, it was you.


00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:45.036
No!


00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:48.914
Stabbing his gut, cutting his throat, thrusting
her sword right through and twisting it,


00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:52.077
the daughter kills her real father.


00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:55.476
The code of the ninja is a cruel thing.


00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:59.070
Your mother, your Iittle sister,
your Iittle brother Ieft in Iga...


00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:00.474
They will be slaughtered.


00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:03.113
Give up, Sugaru.


00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:38.678
The Thousand Skewers do not work on me.


00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:47.515
It's a false eye.


00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:51.399
To Ieave the ninja is to die.


00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:58.194
Remember that, Kamui.


00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:22.756
14 YEARS LATER


00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:25.908
14 years pass.


00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:31.591
The long story of the man
who has left the ninja begins.


00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:55.035
This sinister man


00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:59.358
