Matsuyama, Bicchu Country.


00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:08.398
Charge!


00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:42.433
Wait!


00:10:23.840 --> 00:10:25.876
Kamui's secret move,


00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:28.514
The Well-bucket Drop.


00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:44.357
The Brush-Cut...


00:10:51.560 --> 00:10:53.471
Over here.


00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:00.678
Kamui...


00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:04.314
you could have fled if you'd wanted to.


00:11:04.440 --> 00:11:07.318
Sometimes the quarry lies
in wait for the hunter.


00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:12.949
Die.


00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:15.711
I will live.


00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:17.478
I don't want to die.


00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:13.117
Kamui's secret skill,


00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:15.754
Double-Mutation
Brush-Cut sword charge.


00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:15.678
Mikumo...


00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:23.749
You brat!


00:13:25.640 --> 00:13:27.596
