00:13:28.760 --> 00:13:29.909
I didn't steal it!


00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:31.234
I just picked it up.


00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:32.839
I took such a Iong time


00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:34.279
