00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:38.476
Stop it, Mikumo.


00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:40.158
I don't kill one of my own.


00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:44.356
You're talking about a Iong time ago.


00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:53.596
We can never be people
no matter what we do.


00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:56.393
No matter how many
rebellious farmers you kill,


00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:59.193
