00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:43.869
Lord Ichijiro!


00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:52.072
Forgive me!


00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:58.031
Lord Ichijiro!


00:17:04.240 --> 00:17:07.596
Seeing the man's incomprehensible
