00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:09.392
What the...?


00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:31.236
As if lured by the raging sea,


00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:34.830
Kamui got into the man's boat.


00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:44.110
Why did you cut off the horse's Ieg?


00:20:44.240 --> 00:20:45.832
Aha!


00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:50.911
