00:28:28.960 --> 00:28:30.916
You threw me into the sea!


00:28:31.040 --> 00:28:31.995
Stop it!


00:28:32.680 --> 00:28:34.159
Stop it!


00:28:36.000 --> 00:28:37.956
You're alive, as I thought.


00:28:38.400 --> 00:28:40.038
It's thanks to me.


00:28:42.080 --> 00:28:43.832
Stop Iaughing!


00:28:43.960 --> 00:28:46.758
