00:28:52.160 --> 00:28:53.878
Stop!


00:28:55.280 --> 00:28:57.669
This is Sayaka, my girl.


00:28:58.680 --> 00:29:01.956
I took my clothes off to keep you warm.


00:29:02.080 --> 00:29:05.311
I can't die while I have this Iot.


00:29:05.440 --> 00:29:07.078
That means


00:29:07.200 --> 00:29:09.430
