00:44:11.240 --> 00:44:12.355
That's...


00:44:13.480 --> 00:44:15.789
not decided yet.


00:44:35.160 --> 00:44:36.115
Kamui!


00:44:57.640 --> 00:44:58.789
Hey...


00:45:00.480 --> 00:45:04.029
Stay here and become a fisherman.


00:45:12.360 --> 00:45:14.112
14 years ago...


00:45:15.200 --> 00:45:21.992
Oshika was washed up on
this shore, just Iike you.


00:45:51.080 --> 00:45:52.479
So you knew


00:45:53.440 --> 00:45:54.634
your wife's background?


00:45:57.560 --> 00:45:59.755
When I Iet you on my boat


00:46:00.880 --> 00:46:03.553
you smelt the same as Oshika.


00:46:04.600 --> 00:46:08.036
So I threw you into the sea.


00:46:10.320 --> 00:46:12.356
Do you think I'II turn your wife in?


00:46:14.720 --> 00:46:16.915
I don't know you people's rules.


00:46:17.040 --> 00:46:18.359
And I don't want to know them.


00:46:20.040 --> 00:46:21.393
For me...


00:46:22.320 --> 00:46:25.118
Oshika is my one and only wife.


00:46:25.240 --> 00:46:28.676
For Sayaka, she is her one and only mum.


00:46:29.680 --> 00:46:31.238
PIease, Kamui.


00:46:31.360 --> 00:46:33.191
Stay here and become a fisherman.


00:46:33.320 --> 00:46:36.073
PIease take Oshika's secret
to the grave with you.


00:46:37.040 --> 00:46:38.393
I beg you, Kamui.


00:46:39.800 --> 00:46:41.472
I'm begging you.


00:47:05.120 --> 00:47:08.556
PIease, pick it up
and take a closer Iook.


00:47:19.440 --> 00:47:20.759
I'II have this one.


00:47:25.200 --> 00:47:29.398
"His height is about 5'7"...


00:47:29.880 --> 00:47:33.919
"He Iooks about 45 years old...


00:47:34.920 --> 00:47:36.194
"He is dark skinned


00:47:36.320 --> 00:47:38.390
"and has a beard.


00:47:38.520 --> 00:47:43.036
"His hair is Iong and
is tied at the back.


00:47:43.160 --> 00:47:47.199
"He killed the Iord's horse Ichijiro


00:47:47.720 --> 00:47:49.199
"and dismembered his Ieg..."


00:47:49.320 --> 00:47:50.799
Hanbei...?


00:48:03.640 --> 00:48:05.039
The horns...?


00:48:29.440 --> 00:48:31.476
- Does that feel nice?
- Yeah.


00:49:25.160 --> 00:49:27.754
Farewell, Kushikiga Island.


00:49:30.160 --> 00:49:32.913
Farewell, Oshika.


00:51:30.760 --> 00:51:31.875
Why do you chase me?


00:51:33.680 --> 00:51:37.468
If I Iet you go, they will eventually
come from Iga Iooking for me.


00:51:49.440 --> 00:51:52.113
You Iaughed at my
suspicious mind, didn't you?


00:51:53.520 --> 00:51:57.274
It's because of my suspicious
mind that I have survived this far.


00:51:58.520 --> 00:51:59.839
Sugaru...


00:52:02.440 --> 00:52:04.556
Hanbei knows about you.


00:52:08.400 --> 00:52:12.393
He has been Iiving with you,
even though he knows everything.


00:52:13.240 --> 00:52:14.753
Shut up!


00:52:14.880 --> 00:52:19.590
Even though he knows, he tries
to protect you with his Iife.


00:52:22.720 --> 00:52:23.869
In that case...


00:52:26.720 --> 00:52:31.589
I must protect Hanbei with my Iife, too.


00:52:46.560 --> 00:52:48.312
I won't move.


00:52:51.800 --> 00:52:53.119
Do it.


00:53:09.680 --> 00:53:11.716
Why did you miss the spot?


00:53:16.320 --> 00:53:18.436
If Sugaru had done it...


00:53:23.080 --> 00:53:24.991
she wouldn't have missed.


00:53:30.120 --> 00:53:31.473
Oshika...


00:53:34.040 --> 00:53:36.508
I don't know anyone called Sugaru.


00:53:50.600 --> 00:53:52.397
Throw more water on it!


00:53:54.560 --> 00:53:56.835
Hurry up, hurry!


00:54:01.880 --> 00:54:04.155
Mum! Mum!


00:54:04.840 --> 00:54:05.955
Mum!


00:54:06.080 --> 00:54:07.115
Mum!


00:54:07.240 --> 00:54:08.434
Dad has...


00:54:09.280 --> 00:54:11.271
been taken away by officials!


00:54:11.960 --> 00:54:13.359
By officials?


00:54:13.480 --> 00:54:15.550
Mum!


00:54:29.880 --> 00:54:30.949
Damn you!


00:54:31.080 --> 00:54:32.638
Sayaka!


00:54:59.520 --> 00:55:00.953
Sayaka...


00:55:02.240 --> 00:55:03.673
What are you doing?


00:55:05.280 --> 00:55:06.918
That's Dad's...


00:55:11.360 --> 00:55:13.920
Here, Sayaka, a comb.


00:55:15.280 --> 00:55:16.474
A red comb.


00:55:17.400 --> 00:55:18.879
It will really suit you.


00:55:19.880 --> 00:55:24.829
Did you turn him in?


00:55:27.240 --> 00:55:29.196
Did you turn my Dad in?


00:55:32.880 --> 00:55:34.359
You are...


00:55:36.040 --> 00:55:38.395
You are a truly ugly man!


00:55:42.120 --> 00:55:43.553
What?!


00:55:45.000 --> 00:55:47.594
He killed a Iord's horse!


00:55:48.280 --> 00:55:50.191
Of course he should be caught!


00:55:55.560 --> 00:55:56.595
I won't forgive you.


00:56:10.200 --> 00:56:11.758
Sayaka...


00:56:11.880 --> 00:56:14.440
there's no need for you to be tarnished.


00:56:15.680 --> 00:56:18.558
Kitsuto grassed up Hanbei!


00:56:30.360 --> 00:56:33.352
Kitsuto, you're a demon.


00:56:34.880 --> 00:56:37.713
You turned Hanbei in!


00:56:39.880 --> 00:56:42.440
AII right, just do him!


00:56:56.240 --> 00:56:57.355
Sayaka!


00:57:03.120 --> 00:57:05.953
I'm going to rescue Hanbei.


00:57:56.280 --> 00:57:59.716
Hanbei, from Asaka
District, Kushikiga Island!


00:58:03.280 --> 00:58:04.554
Begin!


00:58:11.720 --> 00:58:12.630
Wait.


00:58:26.600 --> 00:58:27.715
Bring my bow.


00:58:27.840 --> 00:58:29.034
Lord!


00:58:29.160 --> 00:58:30.593
Lord...


00:58:30.720 --> 00:58:32.472
this is an unclean place...


00:58:34.560 --> 00:58:37.757
Lord, please do not get any closer!


00:58:42.400 --> 00:58:43.469
Hanbei...


00:58:45.520 --> 00:58:47.636
was it the Ieft Ieg?


00:59:01.240 --> 00:59:02.992
No, it wasn't.


00:59:06.000 --> 00:59:08.116
I was confused.


00:59:09.520 --> 00:59:11.590
It was the right Ieg...


00:59:15.320 --> 00:59:16.548
that my Ichijiro had cut off.


00:59:39.600 --> 00:59:41.830
Stop them! Quick!


00:59:58.320 --> 00:59:59.309
Oshika...


00:59:59.440 --> 01:00:00.509
Don't Iet them get away!


01:00:02.640 --> 01:00:03.755
Ayu!


01:00:04.680 --> 01:00:06.159
I think today is the day...


01:01:25.520 --> 01:01:27.078
Genta!


01:01:32.120 --> 01:01:33.473
Water...


01:02:13.120 --> 01:02:14.633
There's an island.


01:02:14.760 --> 01:02:16.193
It's Saki Island.


01:02:18.560 --> 01:02:20.471
We're almost there.


01:02:31.920 --> 01:02:33.399
Hey...


01:02:33.520 --> 01:02:35.636
What...What are they?


01:02:37.240 --> 01:02:38.559
They're...


01:02:41.320 --> 01:02:42.355
net-fishing boats.


01:02:45.120 --> 01:02:46.633
We're saved!


01:03:06.520 --> 01:03:07.635
Hey...


01:03:08.960 --> 01:03:10.871
Is there anyone there?


01:04:45.080 --> 01:04:47.435
Appearing as if out of nowhere...


01:04:50.080 --> 01:04:52.719
were these men barbarians?


01:04:53.480 --> 01:04:55.118
Pirates?


01:04:55.680 --> 01:04:57.352
Or...?


01:05:04.520 --> 01:05:05.669
Hey!


01:05:06.480 --> 01:05:08.436
Hey! Everybody!


01:05:09.040 --> 01:05:11.395
It's the Watari men!


01:05:14.120 --> 01:05:15.633
It's the Watari!


01:05:18.360 --> 01:05:20.828
The best shark slayers
in the West Country!


01:05:21.720 --> 01:05:24.393
The Watari are here for us!


01:05:26.160 --> 01:05:27.957
The Watari men!


01:05:37.600 --> 01:05:39.192
The Watari men!


01:06:29.800 --> 01:06:31.472
We are the Watari.


01:06:32.480 --> 01:06:34.391
I am Fudo of Kashiwa.


01:06:36.920 --> 01:06:38.751
Who is the head of the village?


01:06:41.120 --> 01:06:42.678
Who is it?


01:06:49.920 --> 01:06:51.558
I'm Kazuto Osano.


01:06:52.840 --> 01:06:54.592
We are happy you're here.


01:06:54.720 --> 01:06:58.269
Hanbei, how come you
turned up with them?


01:06:58.400 --> 01:07:03.155
They saved us when we were
being attacked by sharks.


01:07:04.280 --> 01:07:05.599
Ten days!


01:07:07.560 --> 01:07:11.553
We'II kill every single one
of those sharks in ten days.


01:07:18.080 --> 01:07:19.798
Mr Fudo,


01:07:20.520 --> 01:07:24.354
this island has no money.


01:07:32.640 --> 01:07:38.795
We can only offer one
small coin for each shark.


01:07:44.560 --> 01:07:49.350
And...some rice at the end...


01:07:51.840 --> 01:07:52.989
Rice?


01:07:54.160 --> 01:07:58.278
We could offer one barrel
of rice for the job done.


01:07:58.400 --> 01:07:59.435
How does that sound?


01:08:02.840 --> 01:08:04.193
We don't need the money.


01:08:04.320 --> 01:08:07.232
But we'II take one barrel
of rice, plus sake and meals.


01:08:07.360 --> 01:08:09.635
And some good water.


01:08:10.800 --> 01:08:12.279
They are real men!


01:08:12.400 --> 01:08:14.914
The Watari are real men!


01:08:16.520 --> 01:08:17.555
It's women we want.


01:08:40.960 --> 01:08:42.678
Seems you're not a coward.


01:08:43.440 --> 01:08:45.510
You two come on the boat with us.


01:09:31.200 --> 01:09:33.668
Kamui grew up in the mountains, right?


01:09:34.840 --> 01:09:36.273
Sayaka...


01:09:38.920 --> 01:09:42.276
He'II fall into the sea
and be eaten by sharks.


01:09:47.880 --> 01:09:49.598
Kamui will...


01:09:49.720 --> 01:09:51.597
one day Ieave us.


01:09:54.440 --> 01:09:56.351
He's going to become a fisherman.


01:09:57.120 --> 01:09:58.599
Dad said so.


01:09:58.720 --> 01:10:00.790
I can tell these things...


01:10:02.400 --> 01:10:05.836
Kamui will make you unhappy.


01:10:07.000 --> 01:10:07.955
That's not true!


01:10:08.080 --> 01:10:10.469
You don't Iike him!


01:10:10.600 --> 01:10:13.114
He saved Dad's Iife!


01:10:13.600 --> 01:10:15.830
You don't Iike him!


01:10:20.560 --> 01:10:23.438
Mum, don't you Iike Kamui?


01:10:31.400 --> 01:10:32.719
That's not it.


01:11:18.560 --> 01:11:20.278
Watch carefully.


01:11:30.840 --> 01:11:32.034
Chief!


01:11:35.800 --> 01:11:36.869
It's coming.


01:12:08.280 --> 01:12:09.838
Young Iads,


01:12:09.960 --> 01:12:11.313
watch.


01:12:28.160 --> 01:12:30.151
Marvellous!


01:12:33.040 --> 01:12:34.678
That's what we expect from the Chief!


01:12:59.160 --> 01:13:00.832
How's that?


01:13:00.960 --> 01:13:03.076
Fur hunters have nothing on us!


01:13:04.080 --> 01:13:05.593
You Iot...


01:13:05.720 --> 01:13:06.869
are no ordinary men.


01:13:07.000 --> 01:13:08.718
Young Iad,


01:13:08.840 --> 01:13:09.716
you...


01:13:09.840 --> 01:13:10.909
Where are you from?


01:13:21.160 --> 01:13:22.354
Doesn't matter.


01:13:22.480 --> 01:13:24.391
Our fun is ahead of us.


01:13:36.960 --> 01:13:38.871
PIease, eat this too.


01:13:40.560 --> 01:13:41.675
Looks good!


01:13:48.280 --> 01:13:49.759
I'm soaked through!


01:13:51.000 --> 01:13:54.231
I want you to dry my whole
body, every part of it.


01:13:54.360 --> 01:13:55.793
Right, Iads?


01:13:59.520 --> 01:14:02.512
He's got to be kidding.
As if I'd do that!


01:14:26.800 --> 01:14:28.074
It's a pigeon!


01:15:31.080 --> 01:15:32.195
Kamui,


01:15:32.680 --> 01:15:34.033
watch me.


01:15:57.120 --> 01:15:58.792
Sayaka...


01:16:12.320 --> 01:16:14.595
Take that from the Watari!


01:16:20.680 --> 01:16:22.591
It's a Moon-Sun Shell.


01:16:24.600 --> 01:16:26.511
It's a beautiful shell.


01:16:28.280 --> 01:16:30.350
This side is the moon


01:16:31.440 --> 01:16:33.351
and that side is the sun.


01:16:42.280 --> 01:16:43.793
I'II give it to you.


01:16:46.920 --> 01:16:48.239
Why?


01:16:50.440 --> 01:16:53.955
Take good care of the sun half.


01:16:57.720 --> 01:17:00.029
Why are you giving it to me?


01:17:04.760 --> 01:17:07.399
If we each keep one half of the shell...


01:17:09.360 --> 01:17:12.989
one day it will try to become one again.


01:17:15.320 --> 01:17:16.673
Sayaka...


01:17:18.760 --> 01:17:20.079
I...


01:17:26.840 --> 01:17:28.956
Take good care of it.


01:18:03.360 --> 01:18:04.475
What's up?


01:18:05.280 --> 01:18:06.633
Are you drunk?


01:18:41.360 --> 01:18:42.873
- There!
- Get him!


01:19:12.360 --> 01:19:16.273
How will Kamui get out of that one, eh?


01:19:17.960 --> 01:19:19.871
That's what we want to see.


01:19:29.320 --> 01:19:31.880
It's about time he came up.


01:19:32.880 --> 01:19:35.474
Give it a Iittle Ionger.


01:19:37.600 --> 01:19:41.275
I can't hold my breath any longer.


01:19:45.880 --> 01:19:47.359
That light...?


01:20:04.680 --> 01:20:05.999
The sand...


01:20:07.400 --> 01:20:09.436
The Moon-Sun Shell is on the sand...


01:20:10.440 --> 01:20:13.159
If I dig into the
sand under this cage...


01:20:55.000 --> 01:20:57.468
Kamui, are you all right?


01:21:09.480 --> 01:21:10.799
What the hell is going on?


01:21:12.000 --> 01:21:13.558
Sorry to scare you.


01:21:13.680 --> 01:21:15.716
We wanted to see what
you were capable of.


01:21:15.840 --> 01:21:17.034
Why?


01:21:17.160 --> 01:21:18.718
Kamui...


01:21:21.560 --> 01:21:23.676
you're a breakaway ninja.


01:21:25.080 --> 01:21:26.069
You...!


01:21:28.720 --> 01:21:30.039
Relax.


01:21:30.960 --> 01:21:32.757
So are we.


01:21:34.040 --> 01:21:35.758
We're not after you.


01:21:41.200 --> 01:21:45.273
Two rather than one,
three rather than two...


01:21:45.400 --> 01:21:48.153
There is strength in numbers.


01:21:52.280 --> 01:21:55.795
We have survived to this
day by helping each other.


01:21:58.320 --> 01:21:59.878
Try to understand.


01:22:30.680 --> 01:22:31.635
Kamui...


01:22:34.080 --> 01:22:35.115
Last night


01:22:35.240 --> 01:22:37.515
I was put to the test by the Watari Iot.


01:22:38.240 --> 01:22:39.753
- Are they
hunter-ninja? - No.


01:22:40.560 --> 01:22:42.755
They're Iike us,
they're breakaway ninja.


01:22:44.280 --> 01:22:45.633
Breakaway ninja?


01:22:45.760 --> 01:22:47.113
I wasn't paying enough attention...


01:22:47.240 --> 01:22:48.229
What are you going to do?


01:22:48.360 --> 01:22:52.194
At the moment, they're killing sharks.


01:22:54.360 --> 01:22:56.715
Are you saying I should believe this?


01:22:56.840 --> 01:22:58.717
I'm not going to make
any move from my side.


01:24:03.880 --> 01:24:06.394
Kamui!


01:24:07.800 --> 01:24:09.711
Sayaka...


01:24:46.080 --> 01:24:47.433
Sayaka...


01:24:48.600 --> 01:24:50.158
What's the matter?


01:25:00.000 --> 01:25:01.353
Sayaka...


01:25:03.960 --> 01:25:05.313
Kamui has...


01:25:07.680 --> 01:25:09.591
died.


01:25:24.040 --> 01:25:27.271
I had a dream about you Iast night!


01:25:27.880 --> 01:25:30.838
You and that wrinkly-mouthed old hag...


01:25:33.560 --> 01:25:36.438
That's all very well but
he's quite an old man...


01:25:36.560 --> 01:25:39.552
He silenced us with one barrel of rice!


01:25:39.680 --> 01:25:41.079
That's true!


01:25:48.960 --> 01:25:50.234
Kamui,


01:25:50.360 --> 01:25:52.351
I'm going to get some
more water. Give me a hand.


01:25:52.480 --> 01:25:55.278
Chief, we've got enough water.


01:25:57.040 --> 01:25:58.598
It might be a Iong journey.


01:26:00.040 --> 01:26:01.519
Chief,


01:26:01.640 --> 01:26:03.870
are hunter-ninja coming?


01:26:04.000 --> 01:26:07.436
It might be time to move on.


01:26:17.760 --> 01:26:19.318
"Mountain peach tree..."


01:26:20.520 --> 01:26:22.112
"Mountain peach..."


01:26:40.000 --> 01:26:42.878
- Mountain peach tree!
- Yes, I'm a mountain peach tree!


01:27:07.520 --> 01:27:08.873
How is it, Fudo?


01:27:09.000 --> 01:27:10.911
Yeah, it's tasty.


01:27:13.520 --> 01:27:15.192
Kamui...


01:27:15.320 --> 01:27:17.754
please don't go anywhere today.


01:27:17.880 --> 01:27:19.518
Why, Sayaka?


01:27:21.600 --> 01:27:23.511
I had a bad dream.


01:27:24.880 --> 01:27:25.915
Sayaka,


01:27:26.040 --> 01:27:28.679
they say that dreams are the opposite
of reality, don't they? Relax.


01:27:28.800 --> 01:27:31.030
No. My dreams become reality.


01:27:31.520 --> 01:27:33.875
On this island


01:27:34.000 --> 01:27:36.116
we are all together.


01:27:36.240 --> 01:27:38.800
No matter what happens,
you will be all right.


01:27:40.800 --> 01:27:43.519
Kamui, please believe me.


01:27:43.640 --> 01:27:44.755
Sayaka...


01:27:48.800 --> 01:27:50.438
the Moon-Sun Shell.


01:27:50.560 --> 01:27:52.471
Even if we're physically apart,


01:27:52.600 --> 01:27:54.511
our hearts are one.


01:27:59.320 --> 01:28:00.719
Well, I'm stumped now!


01:28:00.840 --> 01:28:01.795
Sayaka,


01:28:01.920 --> 01:28:02.875
I'm with him.


01:28:03.000 --> 01:28:04.433
Rest easy.


01:28:04.560 --> 01:28:06.755
It's all right, Sayaka, so just eat.


01:28:06.880 --> 01:28:08.393
Eat Ioads!


01:28:13.120 --> 01:28:14.838
I'II have some water.


01:28:18.160 --> 01:28:23.280
This is the only place
where we can Iive, and die.


01:29:02.200 --> 01:29:03.349
Tastes good!


01:29:03.480 --> 01:29:06.597
Island water is really great!


01:29:07.720 --> 01:29:11.395
Kiki, you're hardly someone
with discerning taste buds!


01:29:22.040 --> 01:29:22.995
Look.


01:29:34.240 --> 01:29:36.913
Fudo, this is strange.
Let's go back to shore.


01:29:37.040 --> 01:29:39.349
You go ahead. I'II follow.


01:30:14.680 --> 01:30:16.079
This is brutal.


01:30:17.120 --> 01:30:18.553
Too brutal.


01:31:02.440 --> 01:31:03.793
Genta!


01:32:42.880 --> 01:32:44.233
Sayaka...


01:33:05.560 --> 01:33:08.438
Sugaru! Hang in there!


01:33:14.200 --> 01:33:15.519
Poison...


01:33:20.040 --> 01:33:21.519
The water urn...


01:33:22.680 --> 01:33:24.989
was poisoned...


01:33:25.120 --> 01:33:26.473
The water urn?


01:33:29.800 --> 01:33:32.189
The children...


01:33:49.480 --> 01:33:50.674
You...


01:33:54.000 --> 01:33:55.513
couldn't protect...


01:34:49.000 --> 01:34:49.955
Fudo!


01:36:37.360 --> 01:36:38.395
Kamui,


01:36:39.480 --> 01:36:41.198
this is hell, isn't it?


01:36:42.760 --> 01:36:44.239
Fudo!


01:36:48.840 --> 01:36:50.353
It was you, after all!


01:37:17.600 --> 01:37:19.556
My throat is burning!


01:37:21.840 --> 01:37:23.239
Fudo!


01:37:26.880 --> 01:37:28.233
Kamui...


01:37:29.640 --> 01:37:31.870
you will die here.


01:37:43.480 --> 01:37:44.629
Chief...


01:37:46.800 --> 01:37:50.509
You are going to die in
the hell of your own making,


01:37:50.640 --> 01:37:51.834
Kamui.


01:38:10.480 --> 01:38:12.198
Kamui!


01:38:12.320 --> 01:38:14.151
Over here!


01:39:07.600 --> 01:39:08.589
Fudo!


01:41:17.520 --> 01:41:19.431
This is your grave.


01:41:28.600 --> 01:41:31.831
I don't Iike killing people
and I avoid it if I can.


01:41:37.120 --> 01:41:38.917
But you are the one exception.


01:41:39.920 --> 01:41:41.512
Fudo,


01:41:41.640 --> 01:41:43.551
this is not my grave.


01:41:44.800 --> 01:41:47.189
It's yours.


01:41:48.280 --> 01:41:49.315
Shut it!


01:42:33.360 --> 01:42:34.395
The Brush-Cut...!


01:42:36.520 --> 01:42:38.192
Your Brush-Cut


01:42:38.320 --> 01:42:39.719
has been cracked!


01:42:39.840 --> 01:42:41.876
Why did you kill the
innocent island people?


01:42:42.000 --> 01:42:44.560
The more we make an
example of, the better.


01:42:44.680 --> 01:42:50.357
However many of the ignorant masses
die, that is just the way of the world.


01:42:50.800 --> 01:42:52.358
You are...


01:42:53.640 --> 01:42:55.790
That is a rule of the ninja.


01:42:55.920 --> 01:42:58.912
One which stirs our blood
with the greatest pleasure.


01:42:59.040 --> 01:43:00.314
Kamui,


01:43:00.440 --> 01:43:03.637
that's something you know very well too.


01:43:27.840 --> 01:43:28.989
Kamui...


01:43:29.960 --> 01:43:33.509
I hear you are responsible for the
deaths of over one hundred people.


01:43:34.360 --> 01:43:35.839
Is that true?


01:43:35.960 --> 01:43:36.915
Shut up!


01:43:38.560 --> 01:43:41.472
You and I are the same.


01:45:36.600 --> 01:45:38.158
Fudo!


01:45:38.280 --> 01:45:39.918
Does it hurt?


01:45:40.600 --> 01:45:41.794
Oshika, Hanbei,


01:45:42.720 --> 01:45:45.792
Sayaka and the others suffered
much more before they died!


01:45:49.320 --> 01:45:53.632
Savour the suffering of the
breakaway ninja you betrayed


01:45:53.760 --> 01:45:55.318
while you die.


01:45:58.960 --> 01:46:00.313
Kamui!


01:46:05.960 --> 01:46:07.029
Kamui!


01:46:08.480 --> 01:46:12.189
I got a kick out of
seeing Sugaru's dying face!


01:46:13.600 --> 01:46:16.034
And I took a real good Iook...


01:46:16.560 --> 01:46:18.471
at Sayaka's dying face!


01:46:20.440 --> 01:46:25.036
They wouldn't have had to
die, had it not been for you!


01:46:27.000 --> 01:46:28.911
You killed them!


01:46:37.280 --> 01:46:38.474
Suffer.


01:46:40.120 --> 01:46:41.678
Much more!


01:46:45.720 --> 01:46:49.349
Kamui, you are a ninja too.


01:46:50.640 --> 01:46:54.155
Your blood is the same as
mine, at the end of the day.


01:47:52.080 --> 01:47:53.149
Lord!


01:47:53.280 --> 01:47:57.671
It's reported that Hanbei of Kushikiga
Island has been killed on Saki Island.


01:47:57.800 --> 01:48:05.195
However...apparently all the inhabitants of
the island have died from a strange illness...


01:48:05.320 --> 01:48:06.639
Hanbei?


01:48:09.040 --> 01:48:11.031
I'm sorry to mention this but...


01:48:12.040 --> 01:48:16.431
it's the man who cut
Lord Ichijiro's Ieg.


01:48:16.560 --> 01:48:20.348
I'm bored with that. It
doesn't matter any more.


01:48:43.840 --> 01:48:45.831
Magnificent...


01:48:48.280 --> 01:48:52.159
How about if you paint using real blood?


01:48:53.160 --> 01:48:55.116
I bet it would work beautifully.


01:49:00.600 --> 01:49:05.993
One hundred commoners or two hundred,
they are your paint whenever you Iike.


01:49:50.360 --> 01:49:52.430
Because he was poor, he became a ninja.


01:49:53.040 --> 01:49:55.235
As a ninja, he then broke away.


01:49:56.800 --> 01:49:59.360
And according to the ninja
code, his life was targeted.


01:50:00.280 --> 01:50:01.679
He continues to run.


01:50:03.760 --> 01:50:09.517
Is the life that he dreams of, his
freedom, impossible in this world?


01:50:11.000 --> 01:50:15.039
Is his life about nothing more than
continuing to escape, until the end?


01:50:16.840 --> 01:50:18.751
Will the day ever come


01:50:18.880 --> 01:50:21.235
when Kamui can trust others


01:50:21.360 --> 01:50:26.912
and when people welcome him
with open arms, as a friend?


01:50:36.160 --> 01:50:45.512
How many times must I endure


01:50:46.280 --> 01:50:55.234
A night that doesn't dawn
before I see the light?


01:50:56.560 --> 01:51:05.355
Without anywhere to go, I am all alone


01:51:06.600 --> 01:51:16.271
This sea is tinted gold...


01:51:16.960 --> 01:51:25.595
Until the day that I overcome


01:51:27.080 --> 01:51:30.436
My hatred and my sadness


01:51:30.560 --> 01:51:39.355
Wiping the tears that start to stream


01:51:39.480 --> 01:51:50.596
Letting them unravel and set me free


01:52:12.040 --> 01:52:21.472
The loneliness grows in my heart


01:52:22.440 --> 01:52:31.075
I quietly continue to bear it


01:52:32.560 --> 01:52:41.514
Facing another tomorrow
that inevitably comes


01:52:42.640 --> 01:52:47.634
If there is even just


01:52:47.760 --> 01:52:52.709
A little strength


01:52:52.840 --> 01:53:01.555
That stirs in my heart...


01:53:03.000 --> 01:53:06.231
If it's there


01:53:06.360 --> 01:53:15.189
My heart will not give up


01:53:15.320 --> 01:53:25.389
When dawn comes, I start to walk


01:53:26.760 --> 01:53:38.911
Without turning around, I walk on

